---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base>
<section class="route">
  <div class="hero">
    <span class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="hero-glow g1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="hero-glow g2" aria-hidden="true"></span>

    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="kicker">Lucy Chen</p>
      <h1 data-split>I have led nine engineers, and shipped a product with no team at&nbsp;all</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">I have spent ten years in software, three of them inside a licensed bank where I led the team that delivered it, and I have taken a product from zero to paying users on my own.</p>
      <p class="avail"><span class="pulse"></span><span data-site="open">Open to Forward Deployed Engineer roles in Dublin, Amsterdam, Tallinn or EU remote. Available in 4 weeks.</span></p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/cv">CV</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/work">Work</a>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:lucychen.biz@gmail.com">Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-media">
      <figure class="hero-photo">
        <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" width="1571" height="1042" alt="Lucy Chen hiking on a ridge above the coast">
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="readers">
      <div class="rcard spot rv">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
          <span class="badge-pill success"><svg class="pill-i" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.25" y="1.75" width="7" height="12.5" rx="1"/><path d="M9.25 6.25h4.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7h-5.5"/><path d="M4.5 4.5h.75M7 4.5h.75M4.5 7h.75M7 7h.75M4.5 9.5h.75M7 9.5h.75M11 9h1.25M11 11.5h1.25"/></svg>Recruiter &amp; HR</span>
          <span style="font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)">Hiring</span>
        </div>
        <h3>If you are hiring</h3>
        <p>Taiwanese national, <strong>Critical Skills permit route (CSEP)</strong>, available in <span data-site="notice">4 weeks</span>, open to customer travel &amp; on-site.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rcard spot rv">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
          <span class="badge-pill"><svg class="pill-i" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 1.75a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-2.75 8.06v1.44h5.5V9.81A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.75Z"/><path d="M6.5 13.25h3M7 14.75h2"/></svg>Product &amp; VP</span>
          <span style="font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)">0-to-1</span>
        </div>
        <h3>If you are not technical</h3>
        <p>Shipped a production SaaS alone on <strong>iOS, Android &amp; web</strong>. Led <strong>9 engineers and 5 vendors</strong> inside a licensed digital bank.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rcard spot rv">
        <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px">
          <span class="badge-pill"><svg class="pill-i" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5.5 4.75-3.75 3.5 3.75 3.5M10.5 4.75l3.75 3.5-3.75 3.5M9.25 2.5l-2.5 11"/></svg>Tech Lead &amp; Architect</span>
          <span style="font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted)">System</span>
        </div>
        <h3>If you are an engineer</h3>
        <p>Three payment rails normalised into one entitlement schema, where conflicts resolve to the <strong>highest tier, not last write</strong>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nums">
      <div class="num-cell rv"><span class="n"><span class="cnt" data-to="350">350</span>+</span><span class="l">users</span></div>
      <div class="num-cell rv"><span class="n"><span class="cnt" data-to="100">100</span>+</span><span class="l">monthly actives</span></div>
      <div class="num-cell rv"><span class="n"><span class="cnt" data-to="3">3</span></span><span class="l">payment rails</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---------- the one dark band: bank ledger ---------- -->
  <div class="band spot" id="bandSec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Inside a licensed bank</p>
      <p class="band-meta">Rakuten International Commercial Bank &middot; Senior Frontend Engineer, then Tech Team Leader &middot; <b>9</b> engineers &middot; <b>5</b> vendors (IBM + 4) &middot; <b>100%</b> on-time quarters</p>

      <div class="band-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="tl" id="tlSec">
            <div class="tl-rail" aria-hidden="true"><i id="tlFill"></i></div>
            <ol class="tl-items" id="tlItems">
              <li><span class="tl-dot"></span><b>2015</b><em>Smart Catch</em><i>City parking payments</i></li>
              <li><span class="tl-dot"></span><b>2016</b><em>Wistron ITS</em><i>On site at Foxconn</i></li>
              <li><span class="tl-dot"></span><b>2020</b><em>Shengsen</em><i>On site at Far Eastern Bank</i></li>
              <li><span class="tl-dot"></span><b>2021&ndash;2024</b><em>Rakuten Bank</em><i>Rakuten Group &middot; first digital bank in Taiwan</i></li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <figure class="orgfig rv" id="orgFig">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 620 216" role="img" aria-label="One team leader connected to nine engineers and five vendors, one of them IBM">
              <path class="org-link lit" d="M76 100 C 112 100 120 62 152 62 H 186"/>
              <path class="org-link lit" d="M76 116 C 112 116 120 176 152 176 H 186"/>
              <path class="org-link" d="M196 62 H 484"/>
              <path class="org-link" d="M196 176 H 396"/>
              <text class="org-t lead-t" x="58" y="150" text-anchor="middle">Team Leader</text>
              <text class="org-t hi" x="196" y="34" text-anchor="start">9 engineers</text>
              <text class="org-t hi" x="196" y="150" text-anchor="start">5 vendors</text>
              <text class="org-t" x="196" y="204" text-anchor="middle">IBM</text>
              <g class="org-node lead" style="--d:0"><circle cx="58" cy="108" r="17"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:1"><circle cx="196" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:2"><circle cx="232" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:3"><circle cx="268" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:4"><circle cx="304" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:5"><circle cx="340" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:6"><circle cx="376" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:7"><circle cx="412" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:8"><circle cx="448" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:9"><circle cx="484" cy="62" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node ibm" style="--d:10"><circle cx="196" cy="176" r="8"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:11"><circle cx="246" cy="176" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:12"><circle cx="296" cy="176" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:13"><circle cx="346" cy="176" r="7"/></g>
              <g class="org-node" style="--d:14"><circle cx="396" cy="176" r="7"/></g>
            </svg>
          </figure>
        </div>

        <ul class="ledger" id="ledger">
          <li>
            <svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10"/><path d="M6 11.4 9.6 15 16 8"/></svg>
            <span><span class="led-a">KYC CDD/EDD re-verification</span><span class="led-b">with <b>IBM</b>, accepted into production</span></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10"/><path d="M6 11.4 9.6 15 16 8"/></svg>
            <span><span class="led-a">Mobile ID device binding</span><span class="led-b">reused in <b>4</b> transfer modules</span></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10"/><path d="M6 11.4 9.6 15 16 8"/></svg>
            <span><span class="led-a">PwC security audit</span><span class="led-b"><b>15</b> findings closed</span></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="tick" viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="10"/><path d="M6 11.4 9.6 15 16 8"/></svg>
            <span><span class="led-a">Quarterly delivery 2022&ndash;2024</span><span class="led-big"><span class="cnt" data-to="100">100</span>% on time</span></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">Selected work</p>
    <div class="stack">
      <a class="scard spot" style="--i:0" href="/work/coursekit">
        <div class="scard-body">
          <p class="meta">Founder &middot; 2025 to now</p>
          <h3>Course Kit</h3>
          <p class="d">A session-tracking app for freelance coaches, tutors, and yoga teachers.</p>
          <div class="feature-pills">
            <span class="feature-pill">Flutter iOS &amp; Android</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">3 Payment Rails</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">2-Way Sync</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">350+ Users</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="scard-points">
            <li>Both sides confirm &mdash; same record on both ends</li>
            <li>Students check the count themselves &mdash; fewer &ldquo;how many left?&rdquo; messages</li>
            <li>Paper, chat threads, and spreadsheets &mdash; all gone</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="more">Read the case <span>&rarr;</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="scard-media cluster3">
          <img src="/assets/shot-self-list.png" alt="Course Kit self courses list">
          <img src="/assets/shot-local-detail.png" alt="Course Kit course detail with remaining sessions">
          <img src="/assets/shot-local-add.png" alt="Course Kit add course form">
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="scard spot" style="--i:1" href="/work/vibe-code-home">
        <div class="scard-body">
          <p class="meta">The platform underneath &middot; 2025 to now</p>
          <h3>Vibe Code Home</h3>
          <p class="d">A collaborative ecosystem that turns ideas into products, for side-project builders and budget-conscious creators.</p>
          <div class="feature-pills">
            <span class="feature-pill">Platform Layer</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Unified Auth</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">Entitlement Engine</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="scard-points">
            <li>Code is a skill. The ecosystem turns it into assets</li>
            <li>Makers share what actually worked, so the next one skips the guesswork</li>
            <li>Course Kit is the first product built and proven on it</li>
          </ul>
          <span class="more">Read the case <span>&rarr;</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="scard-media site">
          <div class="winframe">
            <div class="winbar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <img src="/assets/vch-site.png" alt="Vibe Code Home homepage">
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="scard spot" style="--i:2" href="/work/licensed-bank-delivery">
        <div class="scard-body">
          <p class="meta">Rakuten Bank &middot; 2021 to 2024</p>
          <h3>Delivering into a licensed bank</h3>
          <p class="d">KYC re-verification with IBM, Mobile ID device binding, PwC findings closed.</p>
          <div class="feature-pills">
            <span class="feature-pill">9 Engineers Led</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">5 Vendors (IBM)</span>
            <span class="feature-pill">100% On-Time</span>
          </div>
          <span class="more">Read the case <span>&rarr;</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="scard-media ledgerbox">
          <div style="width:100%">
            <ul class="minilist">
              <li><span class="mk">KYC CDD/EDD</span><span class="mv">accepted</span></li>
              <li><span class="mk">Mobile ID</span><span class="mv">4 modules</span></li>
              <li><span class="mk">PwC findings</span><span class="mv">15 closed</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="bigstat"><span class="n"><span class="cnt" data-to="100">100</span>%</span><span class="l">on time</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">Now, August 2026</p>
    <div class="status-radar rv">
      <div class="radar-card">
        <span class="r-tag">Shipping</span>
        <p class="r-val">Course Kit personal plan, mid September 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="radar-card">
        <span class="r-tag">Current Role</span>
        <p class="r-val">Frontend engineering at FintechLife in Taipei.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="radar-card">
        <span class="r-tag">Availability</span>
        <p class="r-val">Open to Forward Deployed Engineer roles in <span data-site="citiesAnd">Dublin, Amsterdam and Tallinn</span>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="contact-strip">
      <span class="k">Contact</span>
      <a href="mailto:lucychen.biz@gmail.com">lucychen.biz@gmail.com</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lucychen-ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/lucyc1715" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <span class="muted">I reply within 24 hours.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
</Base>
